ldots ,\\omega ^k,\\eta ^1,\\ldots ,\\eta ^k$\">$\\omega ^1,\\ldots ,\\omega ^k,\\eta ^1,\\ldots ,\\eta ^k$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\langle \\omega ^1\\wedge \\cdots \\wedge \\omega ^k,\\eta ^1\\wedge \\cdots \\wedge \\eta ^k\\rangle _e=\\det (\\langle \\omega ^i,\\eta ^j\\rangle ).  \\]\">\\[  \\langle \\omega ^1\\wedge \\cdots \\wedge \\omega ^k,\\eta ^1\\wedge \\cdots \\wedge \\eta ^k\\rangle _e=\\det (\\langle \\omega ^i,\\eta ^j\\rangle ).  \\]</span>  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixB%23lem%3Aalternating-cauchy-binet\">↗ lem:alternating-cauchy-binet</a> \\sketch Apply the alternating Cauchy–Binet identity to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$A_{im}=\\omega ^i(e_m)$\">$A_{im}=\\omega ^i(e_m)$</span> and use <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\sum _m\\omega ^i(e_m)e_m=(\\omega ^i)^\\sharp $\">$\\sum _m\\omega ^i(e_m)e_m=(\\omega ^i)^\\sharp $</span>; the factors of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$k!$\">$k!$</span> cancel. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:inner-k-covectors-posdef","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:k-covector-wedge-expansion","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:inner-k-covectors","title":"def:inner-k-covectors","label":"def:inner-k-covectors"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixB#lem:alternating-cauchy-binet","title":"lem:alternating-cauchy-binet","label":"lem:alternating-cauchy-binet"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapt